{"id":393,"name":"Canaan","slug":"canaan","synopsis":"Oosawa Maria is a Japanese photographer currently working in Shanghai, China. Along with her partner Mino, she searches for potential newsworthy stories throughout the city. When strange events occur at a local festival, Maria and Mino immediately investigate.  Quickly, the two are immersed in a battle between unknown masked men and a strange, white-haired woman.  Just when Maria is about to be caught in the crossfire, an old friend by the name of Canaan appears and helps Maria escape.  But a sinister plot over a deadly virus soon develops, and Canaan learns she must confront her past if she wants any chance at stopping the perpetrator and saving her friends.\n","format":"TV","season":"SUMMER","year":2009,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:35","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 00:50:43","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":5356},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":5356},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":4072},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":6275},{"site":"ANN","externalId":10270},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":2473},{"site":"HULU","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"HIDIVE","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":785,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/ZrF6at9BKIW0CDjS5AqUExbzgVvqbc8ba7HorG4d.png"},{"id":786,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/0tb3oEN2xR1Gsl8H7BtuS1O3I9jUpE6t9xRitrLg.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":18,"name":"P.A. Works","slug":"pa_works"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":3379,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":3379,"title":"mind as Judgment","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":3824,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":2720,"basename":"Canaan-OP1.webm","filename":"Canaan-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/Canaan-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":27511608,"resolution":720,"nc":false,"subbed":false,"lyrics":true,"overlap":"NONE","source":"BD","ta